Internship project steps to run
Step 1: Open Terminal 

Step 2: Navigate to the Project Folder
Use the cd command to change directories into your downloaded project folder. For example, if it's on your Desktop:

Bash
cd Folder Path
(Replace Folder Path with the actual folder path).

Step 3: Start the Server
Run the following command in your terminal:
python server.py
You should see a message in the terminal that says:
Server running on [http://127.0.0.1:8000](http://127.0.0.1:8000)...

Step 4: Open in Your Browser
Open Chrome, Edge, Safari, or Firefox.
Go to: http://127.0.0.1:8000
